                  "content": "PROGRESS, HONESTLY",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 2.4
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "etrIh",
                  "fill": "#2B2620",
                  "content": "Output is not progress.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.05,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Fraunces",
                  "fontSize": 60,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dVaEA",
                  "fill": "#6F665B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 620,
                  "content": "A bigger diff, a cleaner plan, or another AI conversation can feel like momentum. Sometimes it is. Often it is motion without consequence.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 19,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nUXUH",
                  "fill": "#6F665B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 620,
                  "content": "The only question that matters is whether the session moved the work forward. That is harder than it sounds because comfortable work is easy to defend.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 19,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "IT8zU",
              "name": "cards",
