              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 760,
              "content": "When you work alone, the day can vanish without witnesses. You can be busy for ten hours and still have no clear account of what changed. Tomato gives the session a memory so effort becomes legible and patterns become harder to ignore.",
